{"repositoryId":889411073,"availability":"available","full":"sailaja-adapa/Shresta","name":"Shresta","description":"🚀 Shresta - City Insight is now open for contributions in JWOC 2025! 🎉 Shresta is a platform that helps users report garbage issues directly to municipal authorities, integrating OTP, SMS notifications, and real-time updates.  ","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":7,"forks":13,"created":"2024-11-16T10:05:48Z","updated":"2026-10-13T05:18:25Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shresta.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://shresta.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.767Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.767Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.767Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.767Z","stars":7,"forks":13}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Urban areas face critical challenges like waste management inefficiency, traffic issues, and unsafe public spaces. At the same time, citizens often struggle to report such problems effectively. This leads to delayed resolutions, further deteriorating the environment and public well-being.","Shresta-City Insight aims to solve this by providing a platform for citizens to report civic issues like garbage on roads, traffic hazards, etc., ensuring timely action and reducing environmental impact."],"features":["Civic Issue Reporting: Report issues with real-time tracking.","Secure User Authentication and Authorization via Bcrypt.","OTP Authentication using Firebase for secure user verification.","Real-time Notifications via SMS using Twilio.","Scalable Infrastructure with Firebase services."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sailaja-adapa/Shresta/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"40f45057ef486342502e159bc1dff9e03c5fa330bbc72742d3c25cadd7914e81","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.893Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:30.893Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Urban areas face cr